{"id": null, "n": "0705002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0705002", "type": "mod", "text": "是【大】，此【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0705003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0705003", "type": "mod", "text": "有恚惱【大】，恚惱故【宋】【元】【明】"}
